OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'severe' deterrents
OL,4,Aafter airport drone disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have called for deterrents to be
OL,7,F"severe" to prevent drones being flown
OL,8,Fillegally at Jersey Airport, which has
OL,9,Fled to disrupted and diverted flights.
OL,11,FFlights were affected on Friday and
OL,12,FSaturday evenings after unauthorised
OL,13,Fdrone activity was reported, leading to
OL,14,Fservices being cancelled or diverted to
OL,15,Fother airports, including Paris.
OL,17,FIslanders said the disruption caused
OL,18,Fhad been ridiculous and were worried it
OL,19,Fcould happen again unless the
OL,20,Fperpetrators were "frightened" from
OL,21,Fdoing so.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
