OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'severe' deterrents
OL,4,Aafter airport drone disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe island's government said the
OL,7,Fsituation was being treated extremely
OL,8,Fseriously and anyone with information
OL,9,Fabout the drones or their pilots should
OL,10,Fcontact States of Jersey Police.
